000061  *> Changes:
000062  *> 20/09/2025 vbc - 1.0.00 Created - starting. Prior to testing.
000063  *>                         After testing version will be set to v3.3.
000064  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
000065  *>                          cols wide and MORE than 25 lines deep and this is to
000066  *>                          allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
000067  *>                          be used as areas for the warning or error messages
000068  *>                          to be displayed. 26 lines is the minimum.
000069  *>                          This procedure must be applied at all times when
000070  *>                          running Payroll.
000071  *>                          For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
000072  *>                          by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
000073  *>                          screen with the mouse and holding right button and
000074  *>                          pulling until the correct number is displayed, and
000075  *>                          doing so, one at a time or pulling bottom right
000076  *>                          corner.
000077  *> 30/10/2025 vbc -        Still working on file rec layouts (ws) + selects(sel)
000078  *>                         & fd's (fd).
000079  *> 05/11/2025 vbc -        Adding more SS for data input or display and menus.
000080  *>                         Some of which may well go into another program.
000081  *> 21/11/2025 vbc -        Code taken from py900 Account processing ONLY.
000082  *> 23/11/2025 vbc -    .01 Added support for GL for account nos, Testing for
000083  *>                         reset numbers in IRS and GL when building default
000084  *>                         accounts as they may well not exist AND test for
000085  *>                         errors when writing accounts file which will cause an
000086  *>                         abort of this initial creating file functions on first
000087  *>                         using Payroll as a fatal condition.
000088  *>                         Renamed zz section / paragraphs that are normal
000089  *>                         functions into new names starting with ab000 etc
000090  *>                         as very messy.
000091  *>                         WARNING - Absolutely no testing done for GL as I have
000092  *>                         no idea about USA GL CoA's. Might try and reseach
000093  *>                         this at some point when coding completed.
000094  *>                         IN which case these comments will be removed -
000095  *>                         providing I remember.
000096  *> 27/11/2025 vbc -    .02 Screen size now checked for Minimum of 28 lines.
000097  *>                         All other programs wil do the same. Msg SY010 chgd.
000098  *> 09/12/2025 vbc -        Increased minimum screen depth = 28.
000099  *> 24/03/2026 vbc -    .03 Forgot to Read the param file as data is required.
000100  *>
000101  *>   REMEMBER, REMEMBER to change code in PY910 & PY920 to match these changes.
000102  *>
