000001C *> ***************************************************************
000002C *> ** Author: Gary L. Cutler                                    **
000003C *> **         CutlerGL@gmail.com                                **
000004C *> ** Amendments Vincent B. Coen                                **
000005C *> **         vbcoen@gmail.com                                  **
000006C *> **                                                           **
000007C *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
000008C *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
000009C *> **                                                           **
000010C *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
000011C *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
000012C *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
000013C *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
000014C *>                                                              **
000015C *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
000016C *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
000017C *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
000018C *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
000019C *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
000020C *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
000021C *> ***************************************************************
000022C *>
000023C      EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
000024C           WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000025C           WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000026C           WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000027C           WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
000028C           when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000029C           WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000030C           when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000031C           WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000032C           WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000033C           WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000034C           WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
000035C           WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
GnuCOBOL 3.2.0          py920.cbl                                                     Sat Apr 04 2026 15:11:35  Page 0046

